    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock-Paper-Scissors Card Game Roguelike \u2013 stop time, summon tsunamis, shoot with bubble guns, feed cards to mimic, collect rare negative cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Get 3 points to win a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Drag cards forward to play them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hold a card in hand to read its effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game with Godot4. If you want to get inspired, I made the code repository public, so you can just look or reuse the code in your own projects. My github name is &quot;horridparlor&quot;, and &quot;hardest&quot; is name of the project.  In the README there is link to the Google Drive folder with the game assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have linked as the website of this game the card gallery I created for the game on my website, basically to be used as a data base for the cards. Also, has high-quality images of the cards!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock-Paper-Scissors Card Game Roguelike \u2013 stop time, summon tsunamis, shoot with bubble guns, feed cards to mimic, collect rare negative cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Get 3 points to win a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Drag cards forward to play them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hold a card in hand to read its effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game with Godot4. If you want to get inspired, I made the code repository public, so you can just look or reuse the code in your own projects. My github name is &quot;horridparlor&quot;, and &quot;hardest&quot; is name of the project.  In the README there is link to the Google Drive folder with the game assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have linked as the website of this game the card gallery I created for the game on my website, basically to be used as a data base for the cards. Also, has high-quality images of the cards!</p>",
